body:
fix https://github.com/xch-dev/sage/issues/692

change 

```rust
let url = format!(
    "https://assets.mainnet.mintgarden.io/thumbnails/{data_hash}_512.webp"
);
```

to

```rust
let url = format!(
    "https://assets.{}.mintgarden.io/thumbnails/{data_hash}_512.webp",
    if testnet { "testnet" } else { "mainnet" }
);
```
